Provenance

Source code
  The code in this package was written for this project. No third-party source
  code is copied into it.

Algorithms
  Token bucket, fixed window and sliding window counter rate limiting,
  exponential backoff with full jitter, the circuit breaker state machine and the
  bulkhead (a limit on concurrent work) are public techniques. Reqtide
  implements them from their general descriptions.

Standards
  Reqtide follows these standards. No text of them is included.
  - RFC 9110 (HTTP Semantics): the Retry-After header and HTTP status
    semantics used when it reads responses.
  - RFC 9457 (Problem Details for HTTP APIs): the member model of the error
    report.
  - RFC 4151 (the tag URI scheme): the stable type identifiers of error
    reports.
  - RFC 3986 (URI Generic Syntax): reference resolution against a base URI in
    the Guzzle package.

Third-party dependencies
  The Redis package requires Predis and the Guzzle package requires Guzzle.
  They are separate projects under their own licenses and are not included in
  these packages. Reqtide's core requires no package besides PHP.

